{
    "title": "Solitaire Tripeaks : Blooming",
    "description": "Where Cards and Crops Combine: Solitaire TriPeaks Blooming Scapes!\r\nEmbark on a captivating journey where classic Solitaire meets the charm of farm life. In Solitaire TriPeaks Blooming Scapes, conquer challenging card layouts to earn stars and cultivate a vibrant garden filled with diverse crops and a breathtaking array of flowers. Unlock new plots of land, plant unique floral species, and watch your farm flourish as you progress through the game.\r\n\r\nBeyond Classic Solitaire:\r\n\r\nExperience a unique twist on the traditional card game with whimsical farm-themed elements. Encounter special cards featuring mushrooms, ladybugs, pandas, and bamboo shoots, adding a touch of charm to your Solitaire adventure. Challenge yourself with locked levels that require strategic thinking and clever moves to unlock. With a variety of level designs and engaging features, Solitaire TriPeaks Blooming Scapes guarantees hours of entertainment.\r\n\r\nMore Than Just Cards:\r\n\r\nTake a break from Solitaire and explore a variety of engaging mini-games. Roll the dice and compete with other players in the classic Dice Tournaments, aiming for the top of the leaderboard to earn exciting rewards. Discover other fun-filled activities like watering your crops and playing the slot machine, ensuring a diverse and entertaining gaming experience.\r\n\r\nGrow and Reap Rewards:\r\n\r\nAs you progress through Solitaire TriPeaks levels, you'll earn stars that allow you to expand your farm and cultivate a stunning collection of flowers. Discover a wide variety of floral species, each with its own unique charm and beauty. Enjoy a plethora of free bonuses, including daily login rewards, lucky wheel spins, and hourly rewards for tending to your crops. With so many ways to earn, your farm and garden will flourish in no time!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\uf06c\t6,000+ Levels: Enjoy endless Solitaire fun with a vast collection of challenging levels.\r\n\uf06c\tCreative Boosters & Cards: Utilize special cards and power-ups to overcome any obstacle.\r\n\uf06c\tEngaging Mini-Games: Explore a variety of mini-games like Dice Tournaments for added fun.\r\n\uf06c\tUnlock & Grow: Discover diverse landscapes and cultivate a stunning collection of flowers.\r\n\uf06c\tRewarding Gameplay: Earn daily bonuses, spin for prizes, and receive hourly rewards.\r\n\uf06c\tCharming Visuals: Immerse yourself in the game's beautiful graphics and animations.\r\n\uf06c\tPlay Anywhere, Anytime:Enjoy the game anytime, anywhere, even without an internet connection.\r\n\uf06c\tSeamless Cloud Save: Keep your progress synced across multiple devices.\r\nSolitaire and farming enthusiasts, don't miss out on this blooming adventure! Download Solitaire TriPeaks Blooming Scapes now and discover a world where cards and crops combine to create an unforgettable gaming experience.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Where Cards and Crops Combine: Solitaire TriPeaks Blooming Scapes!<br>Embark on a captivating journey where classic Solitaire meets the charm of farm life. In Solitaire TriPeaks Blooming Scapes, conquer challenging card layouts to earn stars and cultivate a vibrant garden filled with diverse crops and a breathtaking array of flowers. Unlock new plots of land, plant unique floral species, and watch your farm flourish as you progress through the game.<br><br>Beyond Classic Solitaire:<br><br>Experience a unique twist on the traditional card game with whimsical farm-themed elements. Encounter special cards featuring mushrooms, ladybugs, pandas, and bamboo shoots, adding a touch of charm to your Solitaire adventure. Challenge yourself with locked levels that require strategic thinking and clever moves to unlock. With a variety of level designs and engaging features, Solitaire TriPeaks Blooming Scapes guarantees hours of entertainment.<br><br>More Than Just Cards:<br><br>Take a break from Solitaire and explore a variety of engaging mini-games. Roll the dice and compete with other players in the classic Dice Tournaments, aiming for the top of the leaderboard to earn exciting rewards. Discover other fun-filled activities like watering your crops and playing the slot machine, ensuring a diverse and entertaining gaming experience.<br><br>Grow and Reap Rewards:<br><br>As you progress through Solitaire TriPeaks levels, you&#39;ll earn stars that allow you to expand your farm and cultivate a stunning collection of flowers. Discover a wide variety of floral species, each with its own unique charm and beauty. Enjoy a plethora of free bonuses, including daily login rewards, lucky wheel spins, and hourly rewards for tending to your crops. With so many ways to earn, your farm and garden will flourish in no time!<br><br>Key Features:<br>\uf06c\t6,000+ Levels: Enjoy endless Solitaire fun with a vast collection of challenging levels.<br>\uf06c\tCreative Boosters 